                                [5] = "(5 items) Gain Herald of Spring, causing your Green Balance overheals to apply Minor Heroism for |cffffff3|r seconds. \n\nCasting a Heal ability while Bracing consumes Herald of Spring and gives you Harbinger of Fall for |cffffff6|r seconds, causing your Green Balance overheals to create an 8 meter area for |cffffff5|r seconds, applying Major Cowardice to enemies and Minor Vitality to allies. You can create an area once every |cffffff5|r seconds.\n\nWhen Harbinger of Fall ends, regain Herald of Spring.",
