                            ["tags"] = "Visual FX",
                            ["name"] = "Comet, Aetherial",
                            ["description"] = "\"I can only speculate why the Ayleids sought to recreate the effect of a shooting star passing through the night sky. I set up a few in my garden to my guests' delight, after putting aside some for further study.\"—Mage Uryacil",
